# 2026-08-12: Branch C / dispatch / recombination run artifacts — 61 MB across 188
# files (evolve logs, checkpoints, console logs, pids, granite server logs). Same
# rule as apollo/run_v2d2b_* above: runtime data, reproducible from a fresh run.
# The novel_discovery.jsonl events ARE the findings (9 KB total), so keep those.
apollo/run_branch_c_*/*
!apollo/run_branch_c_*/novel_discovery.jsonl
apollo/run_recomb/*
!apollo/run_recomb/novel_discovery.jsonl

# 2026-08-15: Tier A wall-corpus RAW run output — 23 MB of evolve logs/checkpoints/
